  {
   "id": "lambda-density-matrix",
   "what": "Λ 型系统的密度矩阵方程",
   "source": "现代原子与光学物理 II，5.1 Λ 型能级构型中的拉曼跃迁，5.1.2 密度矩阵方法",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "tex": "\\kH = -\\kDeltaone|3\\rangle\\langle 3| - \\kdelta|2\\rangle\\langle 2| - \\left(\\kOmegaone|3\\rangle\\langle 1| + \\kOmegatwo|3\\rangle\\langle 2| + \\kOmegaone^*|1\\rangle\\langle 3| + \\kOmegatwo^*|2\\rangle\\langle 3|\\right)",
       "src": "(5.1)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mathcal{L}_{31} = -\\frac{\\gamma_{3\\rightarrow 1}}{2}\\left(\\sigma_{31}\\sigma_{13}\\rho - \\sigma_{13}\\rho\\sigma_{31} + h.c.\\right)",
       "src": "(5.11)"
      },
      {
       "text": "刘维尔算符包含从$|3\\rangle$到$|1\\rangle$、速率为$\\kgamma$的衰变，从$|3\\rangle$到$|2\\rangle$、速率为$\\tilde{\\gamma}$的衰变，以及从$|2\\rangle$到$|1\\rangle$、速率为$\\gamma'$的衰变。",
       "src": "5.1"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\dot{\\krhooneone}} = \\mk{H}{-i\\langle 1|[\\kH, \\rho]|1\\rangle} + \\mk{D}{\\langle 1|\\mathcal{L}(\\rho)|1\\rangle}",
      "src": "(5.10)",
      "uses": [],
      "why": "运动方程的元素$\\langle 1|\\cdot|1\\rangle$，$\\mathcal{L}$为各刘维尔算符之和。"
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\dot{\\krhooneone}} = \\mk{H}{-i\\left(-\\kOmegaone^*\\krhothreeone + \\rho_{13}\\kOmegaone\\right)} + \\mk{D}{\\langle 1|\\mathcal{L}(\\rho)|1\\rangle}",
       "uses": [
        0
       ],
       "cap": "在$\\hat{H}$中，只有$-\\Omega_1^*|1\\rangle\\langle 3|$在左侧到达$\\langle 1|$，只有$-\\Omega_1|3\\rangle\\langle 1|$在右侧到达$|1\\rangle$。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\dot{\\krhooneone}} = \\mk{H}{-i\\kOmegaone\\rho_{13} + i\\kOmegaone^*\\krhothreeone} + \\mk{D}{\\langle 1|\\mathcal{L}(\\rho)|1\\rangle}",
       "uses": []
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\dot{\\krhooneone}} = \\mk{H}{-i\\kOmegaone\\rho_{13} + i\\kOmegaone^*\\krhothreeone} + \\mk{D}{\\kgamma\\rho_{33} + \\gamma'\\krhotwotwo}",
       "uses": [
        1,
        2
       ],
       "cap": "由 (5.11)，从$|i\\rangle$到$|j\\rangle$、速率为$\\Gamma$的衰变通过$\\sigma_{ji}\\rho\\sigma_{ij} = \\rho_{ii}|j\\rangle\\langle j|$给$\\dot{\\rho}_{jj}$加上$\\Gamma\\rho_{ii}$，并从$\\dot{\\rho}_{ii}$中减去$\\Gamma\\rho_{ii}$。"
      }
     ],
     "num": "(5.12)",
     "note": "书中 (5.10) 带有$+i[\\kH, \\rho]$，且只有$\\mathcal{L}_{31}$和$\\mathcal{L}_{32}$。它给出的方程 (5.12)–(5.16) 由$\\dot{\\rho} = -i[\\kH, \\rho]$得出，其中包含从$|2\\rangle$到$|1\\rangle$的衰变$\\gamma'$，这正是这里所推演的。"
    },
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "tex": "\\kH = -\\kDeltaone|3\\rangle\\langle 3| - \\kdelta|2\\rangle\\langle 2| - \\left(\\kOmegaone|3\\rangle\\langle 1| + \\kOmegatwo|3\\rangle\\langle 2| + \\kOmegaone^*|1\\rangle\\langle 3| + \\kOmegatwo^*|2\\rangle\\langle 3|\\right)",
       "src": "(5.1)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mathcal{L}_{31} = -\\frac{\\gamma_{3\\rightarrow 1}}{2}\\left(\\sigma_{31}\\sigma_{13}\\rho - \\sigma_{13}\\rho\\sigma_{31} + h.c.\\right)",
       "src": "(5.11)"
      },
      {
       "text": "刘维尔算符包含从$|3\\rangle$到$|1\\rangle$、速率为$\\kgamma$的衰变，从$|3\\rangle$到$|2\\rangle$、速率为$\\tilde{\\gamma}$的衰变，以及从$|2\\rangle$到$|1\\rangle$、速率为$\\gamma'$的衰变。",
       "src": "5.1"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\dot{\\krhotwotwo}} = \\mk{H}{-i\\langle 2|[\\kH, \\rho]|2\\rangle} + \\mk{D}{\\langle 2|\\mathcal{L}(\\rho)|2\\rangle}",
      "src": "(5.10)",
      "uses": [],
      "why": "运动方程的元素$\\langle 2|\\cdot|2\\rangle$，$\\mathcal{L}$为各刘维尔算符之和。"
     },
